{
  "about": "Example Teleop Bridge messages (ADR-0017, ADR-0024). Commands go to UDP 9000, one JSON object per packet; Robot Status comes back on UDP 9001. Python tests read this file; Unity tests can read it by this path from the repo root.",
  "commands": [
    {"name": "engage", "message": {"type": "engage", "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0, "z": 0.3}},
